{
    "title": "Makeup Kit - Color Mixing",
    "description": "Are you ready to become a dolly makeup artist in this dreamhouse color match makeover studio? Let your creativity soar as you embark on a journey of stylish transformations for a sweet doll. As a makeup stylist in this dreamy studio, your expertise in beauty care will shine through in each makeover you create. This ultimate princess makeup game is here to fulfill your dolly dreams of merging colors in a captivating merge studio.\r\n\r\nIndulge in the joy of color mixing and unleash your inner makeup stylist! Become a graphic designer for the fashion world and create the perfect eye art with a flawless eyeshadow palette in Makeup Kit - Color Mixing game. Experience the excitement of DIY Makeup, but take it a step further in this immersive makeup game.\r\n\r\nWith every color match and perfect selection, you'll unlock new possibilities to elevate your makeup stylist skills. Dive into the world of makeovers and witness the magic of sweet doll transformations. As a makeup artist, your mission is to craft stunning looks and make each doll radiate beauty care.\r\n\r\nIn this captivating makeover studio, your creativity knows no bounds. Explore endless combinations, color match with finesse color mix, and discover the true essence of princess makeup. From subtle elegance to bold and glamorous, your doll makeovers will dazzle in every style imaginable.\r\n\r\nSo, get ready to embrace your inner makeup artist and create magnificent looks in this beauty care makeover studio. Let your imagination run wild and release your artistic flair with this sensational Makeup Kit - Color Mixing game.\r\n\r\nUnleash your creativity, embrace the joy of color mixing, and paint a world where every girl can be a sweet doll transformed by your magical touch. Indulge in the princess makeup experience you've always dreamed of, and let this mesmerizing dolly merge studio be your artistic playground.\r\n\r\nColor mixing is fun like DIY Makeup and making your own eyeshadow palette is just as cool as going to the lash salon! Get ready to embark on an enchanting journey where makeup artistry and imagination merge into a stunning masterpiece!\r\n\r\n\r\nTo opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit the settings page within this app. For more information visit our privacy policy: https://crazylabs.com/app",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you ready to become a dolly makeup artist in this dreamhouse color match makeover studio? Let your creativity soar as you embark on a journey of stylish transformations for a sweet doll. As a makeup stylist in this dreamy studio, your expertise in beauty care will shine through in each makeover you create. This ultimate princess makeup game is here to fulfill your dolly dreams of merging colors in a captivating merge studio.<br><br>Indulge in the joy of color mixing and unleash your inner makeup stylist! Become a graphic designer for the fashion world and create the perfect eye art with a flawless eyeshadow palette in Makeup Kit - Color Mixing game. Experience the excitement of DIY Makeup, but take it a step further in this immersive makeup game.<br><br>With every color match and perfect selection, you&#39;ll unlock new possibilities to elevate your makeup stylist skills. Dive into the world of makeovers and witness the magic of sweet doll transformations. As a makeup artist, your mission is to craft stunning looks and make each doll radiate beauty care.<br><br>In this captivating makeover studio, your creativity knows no bounds. Explore endless combinations, color match with finesse color mix, and discover the true essence of princess makeup. From subtle elegance to bold and glamorous, your doll makeovers will dazzle in every style imaginable.<br><br>So, get ready to embrace your inner makeup artist and create magnificent looks in this beauty care makeover studio. Let your imagination run wild and release your artistic flair with this sensational Makeup Kit - Color Mixing game.<br><br>Unleash your creativity, embrace the joy of color mixing, and paint a world where every girl can be a sweet doll transformed by your magical touch. Indulge in the princess makeup experience you&#39;ve always dreamed of, and let this mesmerizing dolly merge studio be your artistic playground.<br><br>Color mixing is fun like DIY Makeup and making your own eyeshadow palette is just as cool as going to the lash salon! Get ready to embark on an enchanting journey where makeup artistry and imagination merge into a stunning masterpiece!<br><br><br>To opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit the settings page within this app. For more information visit our privacy policy: https://crazylabs.com/app",
